abstract: "A fully static, client-side geospatial platform and its reproducible Python pipeline, which turn Google Earth Engine extracts of CHIRPS v2.0, ERA5-Land and MODIS MOD13A3 into ten standardized drought indicators (SPI, SPEI, SMA, VCI) for 724 Indian districts over 1981-2025."
